cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "S-AI SoulBot"
abstract: >-
  A consent-gated companion harness. A trust and resilience system that performs
  browser tasks at the subject's cognitive level, in the subject's own measured
  pattern, within the subject's authorized session — and knows when to stop, and
  who to point to. Implements the Adaptive Human Personification Harness (AHPH)
  core: a Sentinel authorization authority, a registry of 23 precedent-based
  Jātaka guardrails, a six-parameter BehavioralSignature, consent continuity
  enforcement, and T0-T6 conformance tiers.
authors:
