    given-names: Sai Karun
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0007-9218-9750
    affiliation: "Department of Data Science and Artificial Intelligence, PB Siddhartha College of Arts and Science"
keywords:
  - consent
  - agent harness
  - browser automation
  - behavioral biometrics
  - guardrails
  - case-law reasoning
  - privacy engineering
  - trust and resilience
  - Neural Harness
